Testing/

# .github/workflows/ci.yml exists on disk and is correct/tested, but this
# session's git credential lacks the OAuth "workflow" scope GitHub requires
# to push anything under .github/workflows/, and the GitHub API write path
# has been failing on every retry too (see session history/PR description).
# Ignored here so it doesn't sit as a permanently-unpushable tracked file;
# remove this entry once a credential with `workflow` scope is available,
# then `git add -f .github/workflows/ci.yml` and commit it for real.
.github/workflows/ci.yml
